<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Text To Word</title></head><body><h2 class="PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer" dir="auto" data-section-id="qx486z" data-start="381" data-end="416">Experiment 1 — Prove a Data Race</h2>
<h3 dir="auto" data-section-id="8jioo7" data-start="418" data-end="441">1. Hardware concept</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="443" data-end="484">Suppose two threads run on two CPU cores:</p>
<div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1">
<div class="">
<div class="contents">
<div class="relative">
<div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0">
<div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0">
<div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl">
<div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback">
<div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="relative">
<div class="pe-11 pt-3">
<div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full">
<div id="code-block-viewer" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16" dir="ltr">
<div class="cm-scroller">
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code>Core 1                         Core 2
  │                              │
Thread 1                      Thread 2
  │                              │
  └──────────┐       ┌──────────┘
             ↓       ↓
           counter
             │
          Memory</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="">
<div class="">&nbsp;</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p dir="auto" data-start="754" data-end="762">We have:</p>
<div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1">
<div class="">
<div class="contents">
<div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl">
<div class="relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback">
<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4">
<div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!">
<div class="sticky bg-token-border-light">&nbsp;</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="relative">
<div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0">
<div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0">
<div class="">
<div class="relative">
<div class="">
<div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full">
<div id="code-block-viewer" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16" dir="ltr">
<div class="cm-scroller">
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼ11">counter</span><span class="ͼv">++</span>;</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="">
<div class="">&nbsp;</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p dir="auto" data-start="788" data-end="830">It looks like one operation, but it isn't.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="832" data-end="845">Conceptually:</p>
<div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1">
<div class="">
<div class="contents">
<div class="relative">
<div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0">
<div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0">
<div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl">
<div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback">
<div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="relative">
<div class="pe-11 pt-3">
<div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full">
<div id="code-block-viewer" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16" dir="ltr">
<div class="cm-scroller">
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code>READ counter
     ↓
ADD 1
     ↓
WRITE counter</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="">
<div class="">&nbsp;</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p dir="auto" data-start="907" data-end="926">So this can happen:</p>
<div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1">
<div class="">
<div class="contents">
<div class="relative">
<div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0">
<div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0">
<div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl">
<div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback">
<div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1">&nbsp;</div>
<div class="relative">
<div class="pe-11 pt-3">
<div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full">
<div id="code-block-viewer" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16" dir="ltr">
<div class="cm-scroller">
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code>Thread 1                 Thread 2

READ 0
                         READ 0
ADD 1
                         ADD 1
WRITE 1
                         WRITE 1</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="">
<div class="">&nbsp;</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1093" data-end="1102">Expected- 2</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1119" data-end="1126">Actual- 1</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1143" data-end="1171">That's a <strong data-start="1152" data-end="1170">race condition</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="1173" data-end="1176">
<h2 dir="auto" data-section-id="10g8yz9" data-start="1178" data-end="1199">2. Experiment code</h2>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1201" data-end="1208">Create:</p>
<div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1">
<div class="">
<div class="contents">
<div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl">
<div class="relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback">
<div class="relative">
<div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0">
<div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0">
<div class="">
<div class="relative">
<div class="">
<div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full">
<div id="code-block-viewer" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16" dir="ltr">
<div class="cm-scroller">
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
<p>import java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicInteger;</p>
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
<p>public class DataRaceFixed {</p>
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; static AtomicInteger counter = new AtomicInteger(0);</p>
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {</p>
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; int threads = 10;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; int increments = 1_000_000;</p>
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Thread[] workers = new Thread[threads];</p>
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; for (int i = 0; i &lt; threads; i++) {</p>
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; workers[i] = new Thread(() -&gt; {</p>
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; for (int j = 0; j &lt; increments; j++) {<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; counter.incrementAndGet();<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</p>
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; });</p>
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; workers[i].start();<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</p>
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; for (Thread worker : workers) {<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; worker.join();<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</p>
<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; System.out.println("Expected: " + threads * increments);<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; System.out.println("Actual: &nbsp; " + counter.get());<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; }<br>}</p>
<pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0">&nbsp;</pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<hr data-start="1948" data-end="1951">
<h2 dir="auto" data-section-id="d0lu6e" data-start="1953" data-end="1978">3. What should happen?</h2>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1980" data-end="1989">Expected:</p>
<div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1">
<div class="">
<div class="contents">
<div class="relative">
<div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0">
<div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0">
<div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl">
<div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback">
