<h3 dir="auto" data-section-id="1w0ir2m" data-start="4229" data-end="4252">Hardware connection</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="4254" data-end="4347">The threads may execute on different cores, each with its own caches and execution machinery.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="4349" data-end="4495">The CPU/JVM must provide appropriate synchronization guarantees so that competing updates don't simply overwrite one another without coordination.</p></body></html>